Build output for p9/cmd goes here (compiled .dis files, gitignored - see
.gitignore's /p9/dis entries and p9/cmd/mkfile's DISBIN).

This directory is kept separate from the tree's regular /dis on purpose -
see doc/plan9-port.md, "Rule: Limbo-native, in a separate bindable tree".
Nothing here is on a running emu's default namespace until you ask for it:

	bind -a /p9/dis /dis

This file exists only so the empty directory survives being checked in;
delete it if that ever stops being true (i.e. once a tracked non-.dis file
lives here for some other reason).
